graphify-out/
# Throwaway UI-audit probes and screenshots.
# The auditors default to writing screenshots under /tmp (UI_OUT), but one-off
# probe scripts MUST live at the package root — puppeteer-core resolves only
# from there, not from /tmp. A batch of agents once left 43 probe-*.mjs and
# 270 screenshots (26 MB) here after being killed mid-run, which buried 40 real
# file changes in 68 untracked entries.
# Leading slash = package root only, so scripts/ui-*-audit.mjs is NOT ignored.
/probe-*.mjs
/probe-*-out.json
/shots-*/
